{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only","id":1507654,"title":"Are Alternate Worlds the province of Talents only?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-06T21:59:18-07:00","id":1507654,"title":"Are Alternate Worlds the province of Talents only?","content":"Talents seem to be able to meander from universe to universe in several different ways. Are there any good methods using only noetic or quantum abilities to shift from world to world in the Continuum? (Other than inventing them from whole cloth, of course)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-06T22:36:37-07:00","id":1507659,"title":"","content":"There are, to date, no official mechanics for <i>anything</i> traveling world to world, save only for Martians and the Aether in <b>TC: Aether</b>. We have just received a teaser about the next section of the TCPG that details some ways for Talents to world-hop; but that's not technically official yet. Heck, even the Aether stuff hasn't yet been officially published: the book has been crowdfunded, but hasn't been formally released yet.<br /> <br /> With that said, Aether is the byproduct of a race of beings who have harnessed Quantum powers drilling through several layers of alternate realities. So yes, it is possible to use Quantum to world-hop, with the Flux-like Aether being a byproduct of doing so. None of the existing Quantum Powers cover this, though; so if you want a Quantum world-hopper, you're on your own.<br /> <br /> In theory, I could see a rationale for noetic world-hoppers as well: but there isn't even an equivalent of \u201cQuantum-based aliens have invaded Earth from another dimension in the past\u201d to back it up. If I were to do it, I'd probably make it a synergistic benefit of using Clairsentience and Teleportation together, as opposed to being something that a single psions can do on their own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 04-07-2023, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T01:43:00-07:00","id":1507676,"title":"","content":"In the first edition of ABERRANT in the Players Guide they had a travel between universes power. But it hasn't been reintroduced yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T19:01:31-07:00","id":1507732,"title":"","content":"It's worth noting that the alternate worlds material that's been previewed for the TC Player's Guide is specifically intended for the 'core' line, which is Talent-focused. It's been established in text that there are multiple ways for various beings to travel between universes (like Perfectly Ordinary Human Francis), but rules on how to do so with quantum or psi are likely to be in books specifically intended for that. But there's a lot that you can handle with Storyguide hand-waving, unless you're doing something like &quot;Dr. Scientist destroyed the Macguffin Device, how do we stop the reactor from going critical now?&quot; &quot;Don't worry, I'll travel to an alternate timeline where it still exists, grab it, and be right back.&quot;<br /> <br /> But, like, if you were basically running Sliders using the TC rules, you wouldn't necessarily need to attach any unique mechanics to the dramatic exit through the portal at the end of the episode.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T19:39:35-07:00","id":1507733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythicFox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only?p=1507732#post1507732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's worth noting that the alternate worlds material that's been previewed for the TC Player's Guide is specifically intended for the 'core' line, which is Talent-focused.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not happenstance. They're putting the Alternate Worlds material in the TCPG because they <i>want</i> it to be Talent-focused. Travel between alternate worlds is a Talent thing the same way that reading minds is a Psi thing, or carrying aircraft carriers around single-handed is a Quantum thing. I don't expect to see official material on how to do alternate worlds stuff with Quantum or Psi anytime soon; because in TC, novas and psions are no more capable of dimensional travel than baseline humans are. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T20:35:59-07:00","id":1507734,"title":"","content":"Well, yeah, I was being kind of broad about it for the original poster's sake. But you do make a good point. I suspect that at least for now, 'traveling the multiverse via quantum/psi' will be one of those things left for Nexus creators unless someone comes up with a solid idea for a Tasty Bit or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T21:21:42-07:00","id":1507735,"title":"","content":"Related question - <b>Can Talent take Quantum or Psi user with them by the Gates?</b> \ud83e\udd14 Gates are open for some time and non-Talents simply do not see them - but Talent could point then where, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-08-2023, 02:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T21:33:00-07:00","id":1507738,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Gates work for everybody; it's just that Talents are attuned to them; they're the only ones with an inmate ability to sense them, and so they're the best suited to use them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T22:08:00-07:00","id":1507740,"title":"","content":"While they're not exactly the same, flux gates are very much like the Strange Places in Adventure!, in that they're a variety of weirdness that normal people are unlikely to find. Anyone can pass through such a gate if they do it right, but just like a normal person would be unlikely to figure out the controls of an alien spaceship by hitting buttons at random, they're also unlikely to be able to get much out of a gate without help or shenanigans or both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T22:08:24-07:00","id":1507741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only?p=1507733#post1507733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're putting the Alternate Worlds material in the TCPG because they <i>want</i> it to be Talent-focused. Travel between alternate worlds is a Talent thing the same way that reading minds is a Psi thing, or carrying aircraft carriers around single-handed is a Quantum thing. </div> </div> </div> </div>It's definitely mainly a Talent thing, but it's not (yet?) been explicitly excluded the way that telepathy and reading the future have been excluded for Quantum-users. <br /> <br /> Of course it could be hand-waved in various fashions, depending on how much stretching the storyteller felt like doing.<br /> <br /> For examples that seem to rely only on interpretation of the rules, if a teleporter is dragged through a portal and becomes familiar with a spot in an alternate universe, can they blip back over as normal? (The only stated limitations on teleportation being no intergalactic travel and requirement for some familiarity with the destination). Also, considering that one Clairsentience mode power involves seeing various alternative futures and &quot;picking&quot; the one they want, what happens if a telepath shares the future that didn't happen with a teleporter? Can they go there if that alternate world exists?<br /> <br /> While we're at it, can a teleporter teleport through an interdimensional portal like they could through a door? Can a clairsentient Dowse for portals or sense through them? Lots of questions are left up to the storyteller to decide about how noetic or quantum effects interact with other types of flux and flux effects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T14:35:24-07:00","id":1507784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only?p=1507676#post1507676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the first edition of ABERRANT in the Players Guide they had a travel between universes power. But it hasn't been reintroduced yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there was a Create Universe power as well IIRC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T14:54:48-07:00","id":1507785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only?p=1507784#post1507784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think there was a Create Universe power as well IIRC.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, your right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T17:06:43-07:00","id":1507798,"title":"","content":"Aethergates are based on an exotic form of dimensional flux, and Martians (ie. Quantum users) are especially disruptive to them, causing them to break down far faster than normal. If the same rules apply to natural dimensional portals, they likely won't last long if novas start crossing through them repeatedly. The same thing may be true of psychics.<br /> <br /> I also don't think we're likely to see quantum or psi specific dimension traveling books simply because all of the info for such a campaign other than the specific powers/Edges needed by psions and novas are already located in this book. I really hope they stick in a half page sidebar somewhere addressing what powers/Edges/Aptitude combos/etc. would be needed for them to make use of the rest of the material.<br /> <br /> I also wonder how most squires/daredevils/talents can go through their lives thinking they have no special powers when we now know they can literally see glowing portals in the air that nobody else notices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T18:06:27-07:00","id":1507810,"title":"","content":"Do they literally see them, or are they merely aware of them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T20:20:46-07:00","id":1507827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1507654-are-alternate-worlds-the-province-of-talents-only?p=1507810#post1507810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do they literally see them, or are they merely aware of them?</div> </div> </div> </div>The preview indicated Talents can literally see them. This is how they can easily enter portals without accidentally hitting the edge and being ejected rather than going through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}